Hi, Fabiola -

I don't believe that directed terms are implemented at present, although 
that is an item for further development.  If you need to test hypotheses 
regarding the association between brokerage roles and one or more 
covariates, and can get by with marginal statements, then you might want 
to consider the use of permutation tests; I believe that this approach 
is covered in some of our tutorials (see the "Beyond Descriptives" 
series on our web site). Alternately, you could implement the terms you 
need using the ergm userterms framework, which can also be found on the 
web site.

Hope that helps!

-Carter

