Following up on the recent thread about multi-level ERGMs, I was 
guiltily reminded that I promised some time ago to share an initial test 
package for fitting multiple-network models using ergm().  We do not 
have this on our site yet (much less on CRAN), but I do have a very 
basic test version that I am happy to share with persons who are 
interested.   It is simple, stripped down, and being experimental it may 
ruin your life and harm your self-esteem.  You have been warned.  But if 
anyone wants to be added to the user list (and given access to the test 
package), please send me an email and I will do so....

-Carter

