Subject: [statnet_help] Questions on 'cug.test' with FUN=centralization
In-Reply-To: <CABrS_XEZ1z0mt3mCj-NT4Of60bGeHP1b64XotbKLTXjPqrc-qg@mail.gmail.com>
References: <CABrS_XEZ1z0mt3mCj-NT4Of60bGeHP1b64XotbKLTXjPqrc-qg@mail.gmail.com>
