>
>             etc.
>
>             Note that once you put an edges term in, you've used a degree of freedom, so you'll have one less
>             for the nodemix term
>
>             summary(gnsocial ~ edges + nodemix("fail_count_factor"))
>
>             Basically, learn to use the terms, and make sure you understand what they do.
