>>                   categories). The optional
>>                   ? ? ? base argument is a vector of integers corresponding 
>> to the pairings that should
>>                   not be included. If
>>                   ? ? ? base contains only negative integers, then these 
>> integers correspond to the
>>                   only pairings that should
>>                   ? ? ? be included. By default (i.e., with base=NULL or 
